<title>USA: William R Hough wins Fla. $37 mln Regents issue.</title>
<headline>William R Hough wins Fla. $37 mln Regents issue.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>William R Hough said it won $37 million of Florida Board of Regents University System Improvement revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.668 percent.</p>
</text>
